# Skills shipped by the template. Format: <name> <default: on|off> <summary>
# `on` skills are enabled by default at setup; `off` ones are opt-in questions.
start          on   SDD step 1 — spec.md, flows.md, rules.md
tasks          on   SDD step 2 — tasks.md from the spec
code           on   SDD step 3 — implement from tasks.md, with tests and clean lint
review         on   SDD step 4 — compliance, clean-code and test-quality report
security       on   SDD step 5 — AppSec analysis with severity gate
go             on   Full workflow with a check-point after each step
express        on   Token-lean workflow for simple features (no questions, no review)
fix            on   Small change to an already-specified feature
ask            on   Technical/architecture advisor (no code)
reverse        on   Spec from existing code (brings legacy features under SDD)
commit         on   One clean commit per touched repository
update         on   Sync the project with this template
screen         off  Screen-design prompt generator for Claude Design (UI projects)
security-audit off  Vendored Cloudflare security-audit skill for periodic deep audits
